1
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:40,800
[Her Willing Subject]

2
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:43,680
[Episode 4]

3
00:00:45,470 --> 00:00:47,070
But that is Wei Chengjun!

4
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:49,430
His merit overshadows the throne;
he commands a great army.

5
00:00:49,790 --> 00:00:51,070
Even your father, the Emperor,

6
00:00:51,150 --> 00:00:52,960
must show him some respect.

7
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:54,960
That's exactly why I must not marry her.

8
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:56,960
He already rides roughshod over us.

9
00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:58,000
Once he becomes
the emperor's father-in-law,

10
00:00:58,030 --> 00:00:59,750
there will be no place left
for us mother and son.

11
00:01:00,350 --> 00:01:02,520
What would be the point
even if I became Emperor?

12
00:01:04,950 --> 00:01:06,150
You insolent boy!

13
00:01:09,040 --> 00:01:10,000
General Wei!

14
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:11,840
You insolent boy!

15
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:13,840
Your marriage to Wei Xiang is at hand,
yet you want to marry

16
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:16,310
[Wei Chengjun, Grand General of Dasheng]
Shen Qingsong's daughter?

17
00:01:16,590 --> 00:01:18,640
Where does that leave my house's face?

18
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:19,640
General Wei.

19
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:22,000
In any case, to seal this marriage,

20
00:01:22,040 --> 00:01:24,310
with all your terms,
we can't reach an agreement.

21
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,230
Ningze.

22
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:27,200
Do not be rude to General Wei.

23
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:30,590
For Consort Shu's sake,

24
00:01:30,710 --> 00:01:33,120
I will give you one more chance.

25
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:34,840
No need.

26
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:37,070
The Chancellor's daughter is brilliant.

27
00:01:37,070 --> 00:01:38,040
She has won my heart.

28
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:40,070
Fine.

29
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:42,310
Do not regret it!

30
00:01:48,310 --> 00:01:49,000
Mother,

31
00:01:50,150 --> 00:01:52,230
please petition for a decree
so I may marry Shen Shuying.

32
00:01:53,790 --> 00:01:56,150
Mother, my mind is made up.

33
00:01:56,230 --> 00:01:57,480
This is no passing impulse.

34
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:59,000
Please grant me this, Mother.

35
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,310
Who dares block my path?

36
00:02:21,630 --> 00:02:23,120
I am Lu Qingcang,

37
00:02:23,910 --> 00:02:26,030
here to clear the way for you,
General Wei.

38
00:02:26,190 --> 00:02:27,800
Lu Yuanshan's son?

39
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:28,590
Yes.

40
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:31,000
I know you wish to be the
future emperor's father-in-law,

41
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:33,030
but the Eighth Prince will not oblige.

42
00:02:35,150 --> 00:02:36,630
So what?

43
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:39,120
I speak for your interest.

44
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,080
As for the Eighth Prince,

45
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,630
I can help you win his heart.

46
00:02:42,750 --> 00:02:44,560
The face you lost to the Eighth Prince,

47
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:46,750
I can win it back for you.

48
00:02:50,590 --> 00:02:51,560
What are your terms?

49
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:54,590
I hear that long ago someone gave
the former Iron Cavalry commander

50
00:02:54,590 --> 00:02:56,400
Lu Yuanshan a pair of rare gu.

51
00:02:56,430 --> 00:02:57,310
Once taken,

52
00:02:57,310 --> 00:02:58,750
the two share one life and death.

53
00:02:58,910 --> 00:03:01,910
They must use their bodies
as medicine to ease the pain.

54
00:03:02,030 --> 00:03:04,000
Since you command the Iron Cavalry,

55
00:03:04,030 --> 00:03:05,710
you surely can obtain this gu.

56
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,870
You mean the Yin-Yang Gu?

57
00:03:09,630 --> 00:03:10,430
Absurd.

58
00:03:10,710 --> 00:03:12,470
That is only a rumor.

59
00:03:13,710 --> 00:03:15,360
Rumor or not, it does not matter.

60
00:03:15,470 --> 00:03:16,520
What matters is

61
00:03:17,150 --> 00:03:19,710
this gu makes a fine wedding gift.

62
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:24,280
Shen Shuying,

63
00:03:24,470 --> 00:03:26,000
you want to marry Xiao Ningze?

64
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,430
In your dreams!

65
00:03:27,430 --> 00:03:29,750
An imperial edict arrives!

66
00:03:30,910 --> 00:03:35,120
Shen Qingsong and Shen Shuying,
receive the edict.

67
00:03:37,750 --> 00:03:41,150
By the Mandate of Heaven,
the Emperor decrees:

68
00:03:41,310 --> 00:03:43,430
Shen Shuying of the Shen family,

69
00:03:43,430 --> 00:03:46,470
of noble birth, virtuous,
prudent, and wise,

70
00:03:46,750 --> 00:03:48,310
well versed in a lady's duties,

71
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:50,710
is fit to be the Eighth Prince's
principal consort.

72
00:03:50,750 --> 00:03:52,710
Let an auspicious day be chosen
for the wedding.

73
00:03:52,750 --> 00:03:54,470
Thus decreed.

74
00:03:54,470 --> 00:03:55,710
We thank Your Majesty for his grace.

75
00:03:58,520 --> 00:04:00,520
Minister Shen, please receive the edict.

76
00:04:15,150 --> 00:04:17,270
Father, the edict cannot be refused.

77
00:04:17,750 --> 00:04:18,950
The wedding day draws near,

78
00:04:19,070 --> 00:04:21,510
so this house should be decorated.

79
00:04:32,390 --> 00:04:36,160
The Chancellor's house has had no
joyous occasion in a long while.

80
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:41,520
[Yizhuo Gate]

81
00:04:44,950 --> 00:04:46,920
Come and take a look!

82
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:58,190
Shen Shuying,

83
00:04:58,750 --> 00:05:00,310
how could you cast me aside

84
00:05:00,750 --> 00:05:02,120
and marry that man again?

85
00:05:02,390 --> 00:05:03,870
Hurry, do not delay leaving the city.

86
00:05:14,390 --> 00:05:16,750
How is it going with Lu Qingcang?

87
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,800
Our men will watch him leave the city.

88
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:20,040
Watch him closely.

89
00:05:20,310 --> 00:05:21,390
The moment he leaves the city,

90
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:22,870
end it all.

91
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:23,800
Yes.

92
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:40,800
I have left the city.

93
00:05:41,070 --> 00:05:42,310
You need not follow me further.

94
00:05:42,310 --> 00:05:43,510
You may go back and report.

95
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:45,310
Do you think we wanted this trouble?

96
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,430
Hand it over and be on your way.

97
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:48,240
We still have a wedding feast to attend.

98
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:49,680
Take it.

99
00:05:53,440 --> 00:05:54,680
[Case Cleared]

100
00:05:58,560 --> 00:05:59,640
[Border Duty: Lu Qingcang]

101
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,830
My Lady, Lu Qingcang is dead.

102
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:49,560
My Lady, are you all right?

103
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:55,480
Bring a jug of wine and two cups.

104
00:06:56,160 --> 00:06:56,950
Yes.

105
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:20,160
[Shen Residence]

106
00:08:24,310 --> 00:08:25,270
In this life,

107
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:27,160
I have won.

108
00:08:50,910 --> 00:08:52,440
The entanglements of two lives,

109
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:54,030
at this moment,

110
00:08:55,030 --> 00:08:56,550
have finally come to rest.

111
00:08:57,270 --> 00:08:58,480
From now on,

112
00:08:59,510 --> 00:09:01,360
you walk your road to the underworld.

113
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:03,600
Whether it is the Yin-Yang Gu

114
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:06,510
or the struggle for power,

115
00:09:08,750 --> 00:09:10,870
we will have no tie ever again.

116
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:27,910
Although

117
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,320
I wanted so badly to win,

118
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:37,750
why am I not as glad as I imagined?

119
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:12,790
Lingxi!

120
00:10:13,750 --> 00:10:16,000
The hour has come. Help me dress.

121
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:20,360
So you do not want me dead.

122
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,080
You are not dead?

123
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:30,440
You are still alive.

124
00:10:31,510 --> 00:10:33,120
How could I bear to die?

125
00:10:47,670 --> 00:10:49,440
The man Her Ladyship
ordered killed is gone.

126
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,600
Today is your wedding.

127
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,960
How could I not come for a toast?

128
00:11:09,870 --> 00:11:10,790
Even if you kill me,

129
00:11:10,790 --> 00:11:12,480
you will not walk away whole.

130
00:11:13,870 --> 00:11:15,600
The end would be as in our last life.

131
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:17,270
We'd just die one after another.

132
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:20,440
Who said I would kill you?

133
00:11:20,510 --> 00:11:21,510
I told you,

134
00:11:21,790 --> 00:11:24,270
in this life,
the last thing I want you to repeat

135
00:11:24,270 --> 00:11:25,480
is marrying him.

136
00:11:26,630 --> 00:11:28,270
I am the Eighth Prince's consort now.

137
00:11:28,270 --> 00:11:30,150
The bridal sedan is waiting outside.

138
00:11:31,150 --> 00:11:32,510
You have not entered his house yet.

139
00:11:33,270 --> 00:11:34,080
It does not count.

140
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:38,870
The sedan will not leave

141
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,150
until it gets me.

142
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:41,600
Who says it won't?

143
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:00,630
Will this not give us away?

144
00:12:06,150 --> 00:12:08,150
Chancellor Shen, please escort her to
the sedan.

145
00:12:08,670 --> 00:12:10,870
Child, do not blame me.

146
00:12:11,030 --> 00:12:12,320
Shuying does not understand.

147
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:15,000
She can only marry Lu Qingcang.

148
00:12:18,510 --> 00:12:20,840
Sometimes I doubt he is your own father.

149
00:12:21,670 --> 00:12:23,270
For the sake of an old friend,

150
00:12:23,670 --> 00:12:25,270
he takes an outsider's side.

151
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:27,320
You were the one who schemed first.

152
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:29,270
You gain the advantage and still
complain.

153
00:12:29,630 --> 00:12:31,000
You started it.

154
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:35,390
Unless I am dead,

155
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:37,720
no one takes my sedan for me.

156
00:12:38,270 --> 00:12:39,870
My alliance with the Eighth Prince

157
00:12:40,150 --> 00:12:42,200
is far more than a wedding.

158
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:44,870
You will do it willingly.

159
00:12:59,000 --> 00:12:59,840
The Yin-Yang Gu?

160
00:13:00,390 --> 00:13:01,750
This is the Yang Gu.

161
00:13:04,510 --> 00:13:05,510
Then the other one is...

162
00:13:15,630 --> 00:13:17,320
You drugged my wine!

163
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:20,240
That is why I said

164
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:22,150
fate works in wondrous ways.

165
00:13:28,150 --> 00:13:29,270
You must not take it!

166
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:38,360
Do you want to repeat our mistake?

167
00:13:38,750 --> 00:13:39,550
Exactly.

168
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:42,600
I want to stay entangled with you.

169
00:14:09,150 --> 00:14:10,840
You tried to kill me again and again,

170
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:12,240
and you would marry another man.

171
00:14:12,630 --> 00:14:14,840
For us, the pain of the Yin-Yang Gu

172
00:14:15,270 --> 00:14:17,000
may not be such a bad ending.

173
00:14:18,910 --> 00:14:20,150
I do not believe it.

174
00:14:21,030 --> 00:14:22,200
I have not lost.

175
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:24,510
I will get

176
00:14:25,200 --> 00:14:26,360
this marriage done.

177
00:14:29,600 --> 00:14:30,870
The Yin-Yang Gu is stirring

178
00:14:31,120 --> 00:14:32,750
within the time of a cup of tea.

179
00:14:32,910 --> 00:14:34,510
What are you still being stubborn about?

180
00:15:23,270 --> 00:15:24,080
Father-in-law.

181
00:15:24,080 --> 00:15:25,790
Your Highness, no need for courtesy.

182
00:16:06,640 --> 00:16:10,850
♪Moonlight spills over your hand
that holds the lantern♪

183
00:16:11,410 --> 00:16:15,620
♪Light and shadow chase
across the red wall♪

184
00:16:16,050 --> 00:16:20,250
♪Past entanglements,
how do we settle the score♪

185
00:16:20,750 --> 00:16:22,840
♪If fate turns once more♪

186
00:16:23,220 --> 00:16:25,680
♪Will our endings trade places♪

187
00:16:25,910 --> 00:16:30,590
♪Restraint or drawing near♪

188
00:16:30,700 --> 00:16:34,790
♪Tugging back and forth
between two hearts in resonance♪

189
00:16:35,330 --> 00:16:38,850
♪What tone should I take♪

190
00:16:38,950 --> 00:16:41,950
♪To leave no trace♪

191
00:16:42,090 --> 00:16:44,540
♪How can I keep my head clear♪

192
00:16:44,930 --> 00:16:49,260
♪But the moment you come close♪

193
00:16:49,750 --> 00:16:53,910
♪You burn through the distance
I fought to keep♪

194
00:16:54,400 --> 00:16:56,770
♪The lamplight flickers♪

195
00:16:56,770 --> 00:16:59,210
♪Like your eyes♪

196
00:16:59,280 --> 00:17:02,710
♪Already written into my fate♪

197
00:17:18,450 --> 00:17:22,800
♪Something in my chest draws me near♪

198
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:27,530
♪Like a silhouette, I move toward you♪

199
00:17:27,910 --> 00:17:32,330
♪The past lingers on,
yet my heart is in turmoil♪

200
00:17:32,670 --> 00:17:34,990
♪A test used as an excuse♪

201
00:17:34,990 --> 00:17:37,830
♪To stir the waters♪

202
00:17:37,830 --> 00:17:42,000
♪But the moment you come close♪

203
00:17:42,140 --> 00:17:46,870
♪You burn through the distance
I fought to keep♪

204
00:17:47,030 --> 00:17:49,370
♪The lamplight flickers♪

205
00:17:49,540 --> 00:17:51,800
♪Like your eyes♪

206
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:56,270
♪Already written into my fate♪
